WEBVTT

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:18.760
Stop looking!

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.760
Take anything that's worth money!

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:29.960
Please wait!  I promise to pay 
you back, so let us go for today!

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.320
President Garome, I found this.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.770
My cards!

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:36.180
Outta my way!

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:39.850
President.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.940
What a bunch of cheap cards.

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.050
A rare card.

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:48.860
It's good enough.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:14.100
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:19.640
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:24.110
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:29.950
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:34.920
There's no need to fear

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:42.600
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:48.600
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:54.370
Streak to the infinite future

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:59.780
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:07.890
And will lead you to a bright place

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:40.190
Threat!  Loan Token Hell

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:50.080
Hello!

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:53.860
I came to pick up Dupon's computer.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:57.040
Marco, you're helping Dupon today?

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.230
You work hard.

00:02:58.230 --> 00:02:59.720
Of course.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:02.860
My mother is sick, and I 
have a younger brother.

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:04.940
I have to work hard and earn money.

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:06.170
Wait a second.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.850
See you later.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:16.080
Be careful.

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:23.160
What's wrong?

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.180
We're in the red again.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:31.630
It's great that Satellite and City are 
now connected, but prices have gone up.

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:37.360
Can we really enter the Riding 
Duel World Grand Prix?

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.460
We just have to keep making money.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.600
What about Jack?

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:44.370
Did he go looking for work?

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.680
No, he's at his usual place.

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:48.270
The usual place?

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:52.970
Thank you for waiting.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.620
Blue-Eyes Mountain is the best.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.140
The aroma is unique.

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.550
Take your time!

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.130
I couldn't talk to him again.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:08.240
Jack!

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:15.440
What's up with that ugly glasses girl!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.630
Oh, it's you.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.430
What are you doing here?

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:21.320
I'm on assignment about the duel statue.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.610
Duel statue?

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.600
You don't know about it, Jack?

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:27.550
Rumor says that it grants miracles.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:31.120
People leave money and ask for wishes.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.090
Check it out!

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:36.270
How stupid.

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:37.460
Jack!

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:40.430
Hey, Crow.

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:42.000
Did you finish your deliveries?

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.800
Yeah, a long time ago!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:44.900
Hello.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.100
Then you should have some.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.550
Blue-Eyes Mountain has rich flavor.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:54.270
Blue-Eyes Mountain?

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.940
3000 yen?

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.940
It's now a great world.

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:04.420
Even in downtown, I can drink 
coffee with rich aroma.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.660
What?

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:09.760
What are you doing!

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:11.290
What am I doing?

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:14.950
Are you seriously about 
entering the World Grand Prix?

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:16.310
Not this again.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.400
Of course I do.  You don't need to ask.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:21.310
Then why don't you do a little work?

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:23.520
Buying a single part costs money.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:30.250
That's why Yusei earns money by making 
repairs, and I deliver packages on my D-Wheel.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.230
I know that.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:35.600
But it's not my fault that there 
aren't any jobs that suit me.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.710
Jobs that suit you?

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.350
Please calm down.

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:41.020
You be quiet!

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:44.560
What should I do?

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:45.610
Good morning.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.090
I'm here to pick up the cardboard.

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:49.530
Marco, thanks for your help.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:50.900
Thanks for your help.

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:53.230
No problem.  It's my job.

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:54.450
Work hard.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.550
Thank you.

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:59.520
Sheesh, he's completely different from you.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:03.240
He works from day to night in 
order to take care of his family.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:05.790
You should follow his example!

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:08.030
Who do you think I am?

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:10.350
Don't compare me to that kid.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:13.120
You don't have a job 
because of that attitude!

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:16.830
You keep bragging that you're Jack Atlas.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.370
It's a new era!

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:20.580
No one remembers you anymore!

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:24.950
Crow, you've gone too far!

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:27.530
If that frustrates you, then earn some money!

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:30.680
If it wasn't for us, you couldn't even eat!

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:32.100
Fine!

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:34.050
If that's what you say, I'll show you!

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:36.760
I'll dump tons of money in front of you!

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.000
Jack!

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:40.680
Jack…

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:47.080
Look!  This is Jack Atlas' 
special synchro lunch!

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:49.790
Get out of here!

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:52.720
Hello!

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.730
We don't need this magazine!

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:57.240
Bring ones that have special 
features on Jack Atlas!

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:58.410
Hey!

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.930
You're fired!

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:04.670
Why is there a hole?

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:06.370
There's no need to feel ashamed.

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:07.920
You're now part of our team.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:10.000
You're fired!

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:13.680
These people don't understand me.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:20.100
I want to help him.  But 
if I do, Jack will…

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.390
He didn't come home today also?

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:27.840
Looks like it.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.630
This is good for him.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:37.190
Everyone is so hard-headed.

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:39.940
Normal people don't understand my worth.

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:47.380
The insects are buzzing.

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:53.110
You don't need to hold back, Jack.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.540
You can't work if you're hungry.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:05.140
He's coming!  Where are the plates?

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:14.170
Where's he going?

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:20.810
Duel statue?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.830
Why is he going to the duel statue?

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:26.600
Is he going to steal the money offerings?

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.050
Jack, you can't do that!

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:30.160
You can't steal the money offerings!

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.170
Be quiet.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:41.830
Oh Jack, you really care about me.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:45.430
Instead of taking a roundabout route, 
you should've just asked me directly.

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:48.910
Because I'm already yours.

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.410
What is it, Jack?

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:54.460
Your Carly is right here.

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:02.040
That's the child from the plaza.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.520
Yeah, he was acting weird.

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:12.710
A card?

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:15.450
Please, duel statue.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:19.830
I don't have any money, but please 
defeat Garome with this card!

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.110
Garome?

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:22.280
Do you know him?

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:23.660
Of course.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:26.710
He's an illegal money lender 
who preys on the poor.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:33.140
After lending money, he makes them sign a 
fake contract that takes all of their possessions.

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:35.750
He must have also tricked that child!

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:37.960
Big brother!

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:39.020
Miguel!

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:41.700
Brother, that card…

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:44.590
It's fine.  This is to beat him.

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:47.900
But if you don't have that 
card, you can't duel!

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:55.240
You said that you'll ride a D-Wheel 
someday and enter a duel tournament!

00:09:55.810 --> 00:09:57.810
Of course I want to enter.

00:09:57.810 --> 00:10:02.310
When Satellite and City were connected, 
I thought the world would change.

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:05.770
I thought poor people like 
us would be able to duel.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.760
I thought that would happen.

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:11.130
But nothing changed!

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:14.780
Poor people like us shouldn't 
be allowed to dream!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:18.300
Even if I have this card…

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:22.050
What a bunch of cheap cards!

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.150
Brother...

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:29.570
Let's go, Miguel.

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:31.940
Let's not make Mom worry.

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:43.040
I'll never forgive Garome 
for ripping off those kids.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.000
Does Garome duel?

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:49.780
Jack, are you going to...

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:51.500
I'm going to.

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:56.140
If you take that, the duel 
statue will curse you.

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:58.170
He took it.

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:18.950
Did you see the look on Marco's face?

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:25.030
"Mister Garome, please don't take my money!  
I won't be able to buy medicine for my mom!"

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:34.630
Who are you?

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:40.740
Are you Garome?

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:42.410
Oh my.

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:46.380
Why is someone as important 
as Jack Atlas visiting me?

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:48.160
Jack Atlas?

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:49.070
Who's that?

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:49.960
Who knows.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:54.580
If you need money, I'll lend 
you as much as you need.

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:58.300
You can pay me back once you 
have the money to do so.

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:00.560
I'll never borrow from you!

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:03.300
I'm here for those contracts!

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.320
Contracts?

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.330
Duel me.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.710
If you win, I'll do whatever you want.

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:14.070
But if I win, you'll give 
me all those contracts!

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:15.210
Garome!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:19.220
Do you know how much those 
contracts are worth?

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:24.230
Even if you want them, you have 
nothing of value to offer me.

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:28.860
You title as the former 
King is worth nothing!

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:32.730
But you made an effort to come here.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:38.180
How's this: If I win, I get 
your Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:39.660
Red Dragon Archfiend?

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:43.120
And your Wheel of Fortune.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:46.860
If you're fine with that, I accept your duel.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.080
Fine.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.550
Sheesh.

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:53.550
He's so much trouble.

00:12:57.720 --> 00:12:58.920
Jack?

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.190
What's he doing?

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:03.830
A duel?

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:06.120
Jack!

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:07.600
It's you.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.830
Why are you dueling here?

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:12.800
What's going on?  I don't want to come here!

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:13.920
He's here.

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:14.770
Marco!

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:19.030
Yusei, Crow, Jack…

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:21.520
Garome!

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:28.950
You understand that if I win, I get Red 
Dragon Archfiend and Wheel of Fortune.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:32.440
Jack Atlas never goes back on his word!

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:33.970
What's going on?

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:35.770
He's risking that?

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:39.420
In order to get back the 
contracts, Jack challenged him.

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:41.870
You can't do this, Jack!

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:45.060
You can't risk something so important for me!

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:46.570
It's not for you!

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:49.040
I'm battling for people 
who pursue their dreams!

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:51.040
Dreams?

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:53.910
Even if I have this card…

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:59.320
Duel!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.250
Jack, do your best!

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:03.220
I go first!  I draw!

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:07.810
I activate the spell card Upstart Goblin!

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:13.530
I get to draw a card from my deck, 
and you gain 1000 life points.

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:19.300
He's giving him 1000 life points?

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:25.440
I trust Jack, so I'll lend him 
as many life points as he wants.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:28.360
Don't be fooled!

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:31.150
He acts nice to get close!

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:32.450
Don't worry.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:33.880
Just be quiet and watch!

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:36.360
I Special Summon Nefarious Trader!

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:40.790
I can Special Summon this monster when 
I have less life points than you!

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:47.690
Next, I summon Toichi the Nefarious 
Debt Collector in defense position!

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:54.420
I set one card and end my turn!

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:58.140
Now please pay back the life 
points that I lent you.

00:14:58.320 --> 00:15:00.410
I don't recall borrowing anything from you!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.010
My turn!

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:05.620
When you have two or more monsters,

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.620
I can summon this monster without 
releasing other monsters!

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:10.950
I summon Power Invader!

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:17.490
So you're not going to pay me back.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.200
I have no other choice.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:22.400
I activate the Continuous Trap Endless Loan!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.150
When you summon a monster,

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:29.410
I can Special Summon a Loan Token 
on your field in defense position!

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:31.310
Loan Token?

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:33.080
What is that?

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:34.960
It's a loan.

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:38.420
Because you need to pay back the 
life points that I let you borrow.

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:42.010
Toichi the Nefarious Debt 
Collector will retrieve them.

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:48.780
For every Loan Token on your field, 
Toichi deals 1000 points of damage.

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:51.730
1000 points?  That's too expensive!

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:54.860
And there's no point in attacking Toichi.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:16:01.440
As long as Loan Token is on the field, Toichi the 
Nefarious Debt Collector can't be destroyed in battle.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:06.500
You can only destroy a Loan Token by sending 
one card in your hand to the graveyard.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:12.120
If he doesn't want to take damage, he has to 
discard cards and decrease the number of Loan Tokens.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:17.090
Jack, if you don't discard cards and quickly 
pay off the loan, you'll be in trouble later!

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:20.920
I never asked for this unfair 
loan, so I won't pay it back!

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:24.730
Battle!  Power Invader 
attacks Nefarious Trader!

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.560
Garome!

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:35.010
Nice, Jack!  Beat him up!

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:39.390
You don't understand how 
terrifying Loan Tokens are.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.390
When Nefarious Trader is destroyed in battle,

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:46.250
Loan Token is Special Summoned on 
your field in defense position!

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:49.110
Oh no!  He has more Loan Tokens!

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:52.260
Even if he summons a monster, 
he'll get more Loan Tokens.

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:54.460
This is Loan Token hell!

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:55.970
What will you do?

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:59.160
Will you discard your 
hand to pay off the loan?

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.160
Hurry up and pay it!

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.610
If you get more loans…

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:03.670
I refuse!

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:05.400
I set two cards.

00:17:05.610 --> 00:17:06.870
I end my turn!

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:09.320
No matter what, you refuse to pay.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:11.870
I guess I'll have to come to collect.

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:14.130
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:18.890
I equip the Equip Spell Illegal Business 
Practices on Toichi the Nefarious Debt Collector!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:22.990
Its effect damage is now doubled!

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:24.170
Double?

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:27.920
Since he has two Loan 
Tokens, 2000 is doubled.

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.190
4000!

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:31.700
My monster's effect activates!

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:39.280
Jack!

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.340
Jack!

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:46.050
How does it feel to be 
punished by my loan combo?

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:47.280
I end my turn!

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:48.720
Please, Jack!

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:50.250
Hurry up and pay the loan!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:51.490
No!

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:53.540
I won't do what he wants!

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:54.990
My turn!

00:17:55.950 --> 00:18:01.120
I can Special Summon this monster by sending 
one card in my hand to the graveyard!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.200
Come!

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.150
Smile Kid!

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:08.100
Smile Kid?  That's my card!

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:11.570
You still don't understand 
how scary my loan combo is.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:14.530
The Continuous Trap Endless Loan's effect!

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:18.380
Special Summon Loan Token 
in defense position!

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:22.210
Another Loan Token!

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:25.140
My card is no good, Jack!

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:27.280
Please hurry up and pay the loan!

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:29.350
I won't pay an unfair loan!

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:32.660
I activate the Continuous Trap 
Compulsory Recoil Device!

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:38.360
By sending one card in my hand to the 
graveyard, I return one monster on my field to my hand!

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:43.340
Then I send one card in my hand to the 
graveyard to Special Summon Smile Kid!

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.470
But if you do that, you'll 
get another Loan Token!

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.200
What?  You didn't get one.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:52.120
I see!

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:55.150
Since his field is full, 
he can't summon anymore.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:59.150
It looks like you can't 
accept any more loans.

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:01.150
You have 1000 life points left.

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:03.650
Due to Illegal Business Practices,

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:06.810
Toichi will collect double for 
6000 life points next turn!

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:10.400
Jack Atlas, you're already bankrupt!

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:16.320
Red Dragon Archfiend and Wheel 
of Fortune will belong to me!

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.700
Jack…

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:22.050
We'll see about that.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.280
Yusei.

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:27.400
The trap card Zero Hole!

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:29.350
Zero Hole?

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:34.050
When he has no cards in his hand, Zero 
Hole destroys all cards on the field.

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:35.390
What?

00:19:35.390 --> 00:19:36.780
All?

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:39.860
That's why Jack decreased the 
number of cards in his hand?

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:55.160
And that monster's effect is most likely...

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:59.060
I activate Smile Kid's effect!

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:04.510
When it's destroyed due to a card effect, I 
can Special Summon Smile Angel from my deck!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:07.250
What?  1800 attack points?

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:10.250
Smile Angel, attack him directly!

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.310
Super Smile!

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:18.670
What a refreshing smile!

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:25.240
He did it!  Jack won!

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.410
Garome!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:29.750
What?  I lost?

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:35.130
As promised, give me all the contracts!

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:37.110
Run away!

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:48.970
Now you don't have to pay the unfair loans.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.670
Thank you, Jack.

00:20:50.670 --> 00:20:52.090
I'll give this back to you.

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:54.480
But even if I have that…

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:56.690
The winds of society are cold.

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.930
There are times when you'll 
feel like you'll break.

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:01.540
But never lose your dream.

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:04.820
If you never give up, your 
dreams will come true.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:08.240
Just like how your Smile 
Angel defeated Garome.

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:09.690
Jack…

00:21:09.690 --> 00:21:13.950
I'll wait for the day when 
we can have a Riding Duel.

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:17.390
Good for you!

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:23.600
I hope he now has a change of heart.

00:21:23.600 --> 00:21:24.760
Yeah.

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:27.250
You're fired!

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:30.360
You don't need to say that 
because I quit this stupid shop!

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:31.750
Jack!

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:35.870
Like I thought, normal people 
can't understand my worth.

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:39.210
Just when I thought we could work together…

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:46.040
I guess people can't change that easily.

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:14.160
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:19.170
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:24.070
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:29.080
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:33.950
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:40.890
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:40.890 --> 00:22:44.760
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:50.630
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:54.530
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.530 --> 00:23:00.510
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.510 --> 00:23:03.480
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:05.710
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:10.390
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:10.680 --> 00:23:13.250
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:16.720
You want to party until the morning

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:19.960
At our special place
